| 품명·수량·단가·품번 정확도 | 15 | 11 | 자체 test 0.921이나 M1−M0 비유의, 단가 0.824. [FINAL](H:/dev/invoiceguard-po/reports/eval/final_summary.md:22), [필드별 결과](H:/dev/invoiceguard-po/README.md:378) |
